# Test difference between EASY and Conservative backfilling
# System has 100 nodes
# Job 0: Large job, 80 nodes, 300 seconds, arrives at 0
80	0	300	0	batch	300
# Job 1: Medium job, 60 nodes, 100 seconds, arrives at 10
60	0	0	10	batch	100
# Job 2: Small job, 15 nodes, 50 seconds, arrives at 20
15	0	0	20	batch	50
# Job 3: Small job, 15 nodes, 80 seconds, arrives at 30
15	0	0	30	batch	80
#
# With EASY backfill:
#   Job 0 starts at 0, gets reservation
#   Job 1 waits (needs 60 but only 20 free)
#   Job 2 backfills at 20 (15 nodes available)
#   Job 3 backfills at 70 (after Job 2, before Job 0 ends)
#   Job 1 starts at 300 (after Job 0)
#
# With Conservative backfill:
#   Job 0 starts at 0
#   Job 1 gets reservation at 300
#   Job 2 can backfill if it doesn't delay Job 1's reservation
#   Job 3 can backfill if it doesn't delay Job 1's reservation
